Negative control for the marked entry (G14 refined · AC3.1).

Marks from the raw `sheet=` param instead of the sheet the host reports open, so
the toggle stops tracking the one thing it is a toggle for. Everything else is
untouched — three entries, same labels, same handles, and a click still opens
through `usePlaygroundSheet.toggle` — so the only claim that can go red is that
the open sheet IS the marked entry: with the stored preference holding a sheet
open and no `sheet=` on the url, a sheet is over the page and no entry is marked.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: sheet-toggle.spec.ts — the marked-entry case where the open sheet comes
from the preference fallback rather than from the url.

